Ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4YR1VCZarEGEXKH3j1Ta6fZG0WmfG40TmeRtXNzYiUIw&oe=69F9FA48"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape 2560x1440px.png", "id": "952628337349594", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819417_952628340682927_7092126336638068634_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ehKaF6Gn40gQ7kNvwFXUTLA&_nc_oc=AdobfCsqTPqornFxapS6XQGQH53Gwhy37Y-vxscrXbQWM8UMv_V5UiDVYEIdta5HQIE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7UZb4WyibyveHJoqz3gOckFe-KiRhuA4wR42-YHBRaJA&oe=69F9F887"}, "display_name": "BeatGesture", "keywords": ["rhythm", "music", "beat", "handtracking", "gesture"], "long_description": "Step into a new dimension of rhythm.\n\nBeatGesture is a VR rhythm game where your hands are the controller. Match hand gestures, positions, and timing to the beat for a fully immersive experience.\n\n[Gesture-Based Gameplay] \nHit incoming notes by matching the correct hand shape, placing your hand in the right position, and timing it perfectly with the music. Simple to learn, deeply satisfying to master.\n\n[Expressive Controls]\nPlay using natural gestures like fists, open hands, thumbs up, and L-shapes. Direction-based variations and two-hand patterns add depth and challenge.\n\n[Dynamic Note Types]\nTap \u2013 Hit on beat\nHold \u2013 Maintain your gesture\nSwipe \u2013 Hit the note in the arrow direction\n\n[Game Modes]\nCampaign \u2013 Progress through increasingly challenging stages\nFree Play \u2013 Replay songs with selectable difficulty\n\nImmersive VR\nDesigned for Meta Quest hand tracking with stylized, rhythm-driven environments. Passthrough support available.\n\nFeel the beat.\nYour hands are the instrument.", "short_description": "Feel the rhythm with your hands.\nMatch gestures, hit the beat, and master immersive VR rhythm gameplay in BeatGesture."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https